	And the history entry with the keyword "Provisioning Admin > Unassigned Contact" with the field value "Contact Role" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
	| Update Description          | Provisioning Admin > Unassigned Contact > PRM Koroneiki2 |
	| Update Field Name           | Contact Role                                             |
	| Update Field Original Value | Liferay Permissioning Role                               |
	| Update Field New Value      | N/A                                                      |